+# TASK-260720-1qhxqa developer handoff — revision 4
 
 Status: ready for independent review.
 
-## Revision-2 finding resolved
+## Outcome
 
-`scripts/validate-m0-production-bindings.py::verify_repository` is the production
-decision point invoked by `make m0-bindings-check` and required at the future
-macOS composition factory before constructing SSH, PacketFlowBridge, or HEV
-dependencies. It no longer checks graph tokens by substring presence.
